-- Celebrate This Week redesign — postpartum weeks 15-52, batch 2 of 4, 2026-09-21.
--
-- Continues the postpartum voice established in migration_70 (Early
-- healing + Finding rhythm + start of Rebuilding), covering the rest of
-- Rebuilding and all of Settling into strength, ending at the first
-- birthday (week_number 92 = postpartum week 52).
--
-- Same governing principle as migration_70: rotate across her growing
-- confidence (sometimes, not the default), the funny absurdity of life
-- with a baby, something lovely about the relationship, the stage itself,
-- baby's emerging personality (always hedged, never milestone-asserted),
-- ordinary family moments, real calendar markers, and how different their
-- world has become -- never implying she should already understand her
-- baby's cries, have settled routines, feel recovered, or have mastered
-- a skill by a given week. Any baby-competence-flavoured line ("lights
-- up for you," "developed opinions," "reaching for you in a crowd") is
-- hedged with probably/likely/there's a real chance rather than stated
-- as something every baby has definitely done by that week.

